  "label": "Hoodie as Thug Stereotype",
  "description": "The hoodie worn by the person in the bottom panel is a visual trope associated with the 'thug' stereotype. In popular culture and media, hoodies are often used to represent anonymity, criminality, and urban street culture. The meme uses this visual cue to reinforce the negative connotation of the 'thug son' option, linking the clothing to danger and illegality.",
